(function() {
            P.when('cr-A', 'ready').execute(function(A) {
                if(typeof A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel === 'function') {
                    A.toggleExpanderAriaLabel('review_text_read_more', 'Read more of this review', 'Read less of this review');
                }
            });
        })();


        .review-text-read-more-expander:focus-visible {
            outline: 2px solid #2162a1;
            outline-offset: 2px;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }











    Excellent phoneGood battery backupNo lagsThere was heating issue while initially installing the apps, once it was updated to android 15, no heating at all.Camera does the jobEdge screen is awesomeWe need to use a case for sure, as the back is glossy, fingerprints easily destroy the look.Overall it's a killer for this budget.

